    {
      "inscription": "枝隱頭陀吳彬齋心拜寫  [印]吳彬之印; 文中父",
      "inscription_translation": "Artist's inscription, signature, and 50 seals:  \n\nZhiyin toutuo, Wu Bin, purified his heart and respectfully painted. [2 seals] Wu Bin zhi yin; Wen zhong fu.  \n\n[48 seals on painting] Wen zhong fu (repeated 26 times); Wu Bin zhi yin (repeated 22 times).",
      "inscription_remark": null,
      "sortorder": 1
    },
    {
      "inscription": "7 seals of Qianlong emperor  (r. 1736–95): \n\nGu xi tian zi 古希天子; \nShou 壽; \nQianlong jian shang 乾隆鑑賞; \nSan xi tang jing jian xi 三希堂精鑑璽; \nYi zi sun 宜子孫; \nTai shang huang di zhi bao 太上皇帝之寳; \nQian qing gong bao 乾清宮寶.",
      "inscription_translation": null,
      "inscription_remark": null,
      "sortorder": 2
    },
    {
      "inscription": "6 seals of Cheng Qi 程琦 (1911–1988): \n\nKe an geng zi wu shi yi hou suo de ming ji 可菴庚子五十以後所得名跡; \n5 other Cheng Qi seals.",
      "inscription_translation": null,
      "inscription_remark": null,
      "sortorder": 3
    }
  ],
